# Optional FileManager1 service; add these lines to your FVWM configuration.
# The core starts FvwmMFL automatically. If your configuration stops it,
# restore it before starting this service.
# The session must have an explicit local Unix D-Bus address and bus support.
# Only one FileManager1 owner can run on a bus. WMRestart may make a new
# attempt; it refuses an existing owner without replacing it.
AddToFunc StartFunction I Exec exec fvwm-file-browser --filemanager-service
